{"seq":28,"slug":"technical-writing-engineering","title":"技术文档工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.93,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 技术文档工程\n\n技术文档工程是将软件工程方法论——版本控制、自动化测试、持续集成、代码审查——系统性地应用于技术文档全生命周期的交叉学科。它不仅关注\"如何写好一篇文档\"，更关注如何在团队规模化协作中让文档保持准确、一致且持续演进。\n\n2026 年的技术文档领域正经历三重变革：Docs-as-Code 工作流从小众实践变为行业默认；Diátaxis 等信息架构框架被 Python、Canonical、Stripe 等项目采纳为标准；AI 辅助写作从\"生成初稿\"演进到端到端的文档维护闭环——包括陈旧内容检测、自动 PR 起草和风格一致性验证。\n\n## 本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工\n\n本 hub 聚焦**文档的工程化治理**——工作流、工具链、质量度量与运营。与之相邻的两个 hub 分工明确：\n\n- **技术文档工程实践** (`11_technical-documentation-engineering`)：侧重具体产物（API 文档、文档站、质量检查），是\"做什么\"的参考手册。\n- **开发者关系** (`15_developer-relations`)：侧重对外技术传播（演讲、社区、开发者教育），文档是其手段之一而非全部。\n\n本 hub 则回答\"**用什么方法和纪律来大规模生产高质量文档**\"——是方法论与系统工程层面的深入。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n**路径 A（文档工具链建设者）：** foundations → tooling → operations → content-types\n掌握原理后直接切入工具链与运营，按需回看内容分型。\n\n**路径 B（技术写作者转型工程化）：** foundations → content-types → tooling → operations\n从写作框架入手，逐步理解工具如何服务于写作纪律。\n\n**路径 C（工程经理/架构师）：** foundations 第 1 篇 → operations → tooling 第 3 篇\n快速理解度量与 AI 层面，跳过日常操作细节。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基本的 Git 工作流（分支、PR、merge）\n- Markdown 语法基础\n- 有维护过至少一份技术文档的经验（README、API 文档、内部 wiki 均可）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"文档工程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"docs-as-code-workflow","title":"Docs-as-Code 工作流体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/foundations/docs-as-code-workflow"},{"seq":2,"slug":"diataxis-information-architecture","title":"Diátaxis 信息架构框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/foundations/diataxis-information-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"audience-analysis-and-layering","title":"受众分析与信息分层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/foundations/audience-analysis-and-layering"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-types","title":"内容分型与写作框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/content-types","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tutorials-and-howto-guides","title":"教程与操作指南写作规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/content-types/tutorials-and-howto-guides"},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-reference-engineering","title":"API 参考与参考文档工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/content-types/api-reference-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"explanation-and-adr","title":"解释文档与架构决策记录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/content-types/explanation-and-adr"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tooling","title":"文档工具链","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/tooling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"doc-site-generators","title":"文档站生成器选型与架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/tooling/doc-site-generators"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vale-prose-linting","title":"Vale 文档风格自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/tooling/vale-prose-linting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-assisted-docs-workflow","title":"AI 辅助文档写作工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/tooling/ai-assisted-docs-workflow"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"文档运营与治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"doc-metrics-data-driven","title":"文档度量体系与数据驱动决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/operations/doc-metrics-data-driven"},{"seq":2,"slug":"doc-review-governance","title":"文档审查与治理模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/operations/doc-review-governance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"doc-freshness-engineering","title":"文档持续新鲜度工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-writing-engineering/operations/doc-freshness-engineering"}]}]}